e he  just got some bad news from his doctor  he's got an inoperable brain tumor and  has about one year left to live so tommy  accelerates his plans brings all his  fascist friends together who by the way  are just all sleeping with each other so  they make their plans for a new world  order with the fascist america a fascist  england and ira girls here for a fascist  ireland and tommy's pretending to be  fully on board although of course he's  planning to betray them but naturally  they're planning to betray him too  michael gets the okay to kill tommy at  the drug deal now arthur's supervising  finn and this other guy who are in  charge of fixing football matches but  when a referee won't take the money they  gotta kill him and duke doesn't want any  part of that he's like yo pops i'm a  thief not a killer let me just work with  the horses but now jack nelson goes to  this guy and gets him to betray the  shelbys which actually he already did  he's the one who blabbed last season  about the mostly assassination but tommy  finds out so invites him to a party but  it's not a party it's an execution it's  like yo finn we know he's your friend  you gotta kill him to prove your loyalty  but finn tries to shoot duke instead but  oh there's no bullets in the gun it was  a test and finna failed so duke shoots  this guy in the head even though five  minutes ago he didn't want to kill  people and now he's an official shelby  while finn is kicked out of the family  meanwhile the ira come to assassinate  arthur but they also knew about that and  he gets to jump on him but somehow this  turns into a 30 minute long can't see  anything boring gunfight but in the end  arthur kills her gets revenge for aunt  paulie so now we're back in canada for  the fake drug deal where they're gonna  plant a bomb in tommy's car and so is  this how thomas shelby meets his end  boom  nope he's fine it was the other car that  blew up tommy saw this one coming and  had johnny dogs switch it out he 